aphrodite (Left): Suprema! You have to listen! Horus poisoned you, and they exiled Lucifer through time!
suprema: Aphrodite... if you do not lower your voice by twelve octaves, I will unmake you.
aphrodite (Left Angry): But your sacred health! Heaven is in shambles!
suprema: Heaven is fine. My skull, however, is being pounded by twelve celestial blacksmiths.
leave aphrodite
join jurema (Left) rightmost
jurema (Left Angry): So the poison was real! Horus used neurotoxins!
suprema (Right Angry): It wasn't poison, you idiot! I drank three carafes of Dionysian fermented nectar at the solstice gala!
suprema (Right): I don't have a mortal affliction. I have a hangover.
leave jurema
join aphrodite (Left Angry) rightmost
aphrodite: Wait... you're not on your deathbed? You're just ignoring Lucifer's crisis?!
suprema: Lucifer left a half-eaten tuna sandwich in the council fridge. He brought this on himself.
suprema (Right): Go bother Zeus. Or Atum. Go bother anyone who isn't currently allergic to direct sunlight.
aphrodite: You are an uncaring monarch!
suprema (Right Angry): I am a monarch with a migraine. Out! Both of you!
leave suprema
leave aphrodite
